"var":"VAR_RESULT","cmp":"ne","value":65535},"label":"SafariZone_EventScript_PokeblockPlaced"},{"op":"release"},{"op":"end"}],"SafariZone_EventScript_PokeblockPlaced":[{"op":"msg","text":"SafariZone_Text_PokeblockWasPlaced"},{"op":"waitmsg"},{"op":"waitmsg"},{"op":"release"},{"op":"end"}],"SafariZone_EventScript_PokeblockPresent":[{"op":"msg","text":"SafariZone_Text_PokeblockStillHere"},{"op":"waitmsg"},{"op":"waitmsg"},{"op":"release"},{"op":"end"}],"LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_EventScript_GivePokeblockCase":[{"op":"msg","text":"LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ReceptionDontHavePokeblockCase"},{"op":"give","item":"ITEM_POKEBLOCK_CASE","count":1},{"op":"setflag","flag":"FLAG_RECEIVED_POKEBLOCK_CASE"},{"op":"msg","text":"LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_NowThatWeveClearedThatUp"},{"op":"return"}]},"strings":{"BerryBlender_Text_WantToMakePokeblocks":"Oh? Did you want to make some {POKEBLOCK}S with this old-timer?","BerryBlender_Text_MadeOldTimerSad":"Oh… You've made this old-timer sad…","BerryBlender_Text_DontHaveAnyBerries":"Oh? You don't have any BERRIES?\nIf you don't have any BERRIES, you can't make any {POKEBLOCK}S.","BerryBlender_Text_DontHaveAnyBerriesToSpare":"If I had some BERRIES left over, I'd gladly give you one…\nBut, I don't have any to spare today. We'll have to do this another time.","BerryBlender_Text_CanHaveOneOfMyBerries":"Well, that won't do at all now, will it?\nIf you don't mind leftovers, you can have one of my BERRIES.\nThat way, we could make some {POKEBLOCK}S together using the BERRY BLENDER.","BerryBlender_Text_KnowHowToMakePokeblocks":"Do you know how to make a {POKEBLOCK}?","BerryBlender_Text_LetsBerryBlender":"Let's get started, then!\nLet's BERRY BLENDER!","BerryBlender_Text_ExplainBerryBlending":"Okay, a little explanation, then.\nOh, don't worry, it's quite simple.\nWhen the BLENDER's arrow comes to your marker, just press the A Button.\nThat's all you have to do. You'll see how easy it is when you try.","BerryBlender_Text_Excellent":"Excellent!","BerryBlender_Text_PokeblockCaseIsFull":"But your {POKEBLOCK} CASE is full.\nYou should use some {POKEBLOCK}S before you come see me again.","BerryBlender_Text_DontHavePokeblockCase":"But you don't have a {POKEBLOCK} CASE.\nYou should get a {POKEBLOCK} CASE and then come see me.","BerryBlender_Text_WantToBlendPokeblocksWithUs":"Hi, there! Did you want to blend some {POKEBLOCK}S with us?","BerryBlender_Text_ThatsTooBad":"That's too bad…\nBut we'll always be around whenever you get the urge to blend!","BerryBlender_Text_DontHaveAnyBerries2":"Oh, but wait a second here… You don't have any BERRIES.\nYou can't make any {POKEBLOCK}S without BERRIES…\nWe'll always be around whenever you get hold of some BERRIES to blend.","BerryBlender_Text_KnowHowToMakePokeblocks2":"Of course, you do know how to blend {POKEBLOCK}S, don't you?","BerryBlender_Text_LetsBerryBlender2":"Let's get started, then!\nLet's BERRY BLENDER!","BerryBlender_Text_ExplainBerryBlending2":"Okay! Let me explain it to you!\nWhen the spinning BLENDER's arrow reaches your marker, just press the A Button.\nThat's all it takes. Pretty easy, don't you think?","BerryBlender_Text_Okay":"Okay!","BerryBlender_Text_PokeblockCaseIsFull2":"Oh, but wait a second here… Your {POKEBLOCK} CASE is full.\nYou should use some {POKEBLOCK}S and then come back.","BerryBlender_Text_DontHavePokeblockCase2":"Oh, but wait a second here… You don't have a {POKEBLOCK} CASE.\nYou should get a {POKEBLOCK} CASE and then come back.","BerryBlender_Text_LookGoodAtBlendingJoinUs":"Oh, dear! You look as if you're good at blending. Would you like to join us?","BerryBlender_Text_LeftUsInShock":"Oh, dear me…\nYou've left us in shock!","BerryBlender_Text_DontHaveAnyBerries3":"You don't have any BERRIES, do you?\nIf you don't have any BERRIES, you can't make any {POKEBLOCK}S.\nWe'll always be making {POKEBLOCK}S here, so let's make some together when you get a BERRY or two.","BerryBlender_Text_KnowHowToMakePokeblocks3":"Naturally, you know how to make {POKEBLOCK}S, don't you?","BerryBlender_Text_LetsBerryBlender3":"Okay, dear! Let's get started!\nLet's BERRY BLENDER!","BerryBlender_Text_ExplainBerryBlending3":"Oh, dear!\nThen, I'll explain it to you nicely.\nWhen the BLENDER's arrow spins to your marker, press the A Button.\nThat's all it takes. Isn't it simple?","BerryBlender_Text_OhDear":"Oh, dear!","BerryBlender_Text_PokeblockCaseIsFull3":"Your {POKEBLOCK} CASE is full, it looks like.\nYou should use some {POKEBLOCK}S up and then come back.","BerryBlender_Text_DontHavePokeblockCase3":"You haven't gotten a {POKEBLOCK} CASE yet, it looks like.\nYou need to get a {POKEBLOCK} CASE before you come back.","BerryBlender_Text_SeeMyMasteryInAction":"BLEND MASTER: Hmmm! So, you wish to see my mastery in action?","BerryBlender_Text_TooBusyNowIsee":"Hmmm!\nSo, you are too busy now, I see!\nBut fear not! I shall be here all day! Hurry back from your errand!","BerryBlender_Text_BlendMasterNoBerries":"Hmmm!\nYou haven't got a single BERRY!\nI shall be here all day! Hurry back with some BERRIES!","BerryBlender_Text_BlendMasterKnowHowToMakePokeblocks":"Of course! Of course!\nIncidentally… You do know how to blend {POKEBLOCK}S from BERRIES?","BerryBlender_Text_BlendMasterLetsBerryBlender":"Fine!\nLet's get started, then!\nAll together with the BLEND MASTER, let's BERRY BLENDER!","BerryBlender_Text_BlendMasterExplainBerryBlending":"Hmmm!\nAh, but it is a simple process!\nWhen the BLENDER's arrow comes to your marker, just press the A Button.\nThat's all you have to do.\nWhen you see how precisely I press the A Button, you will understand.","BerryBlender_Text_BlendMasterNoPokeblockCase":"Hmmm!\nYou don't appear to have gotten the {POKEBLOCK} CASE!\nI shall be here all day! Obtain the {POKEBLOCK} CASE and hurry back!","BerryBlender_Text_BlendMasterPokeblockCaseFull":"Hmmm!\nYour {POKEBLOCK} CASE appears to be full!\nI shall be here all day! Use some {POKEBLOCK}S and hurry back!","BerryBlender_Text_SetNewBlenderRecord":"Okay! Today's going to be the day that I set a new BLENDER speed record!","BerryBlender_Text_MakeDeliciousPokeblocks":"I'm going to make delicious {POKEBLOCK}S and make my POKéMON cuter.","BerryBlender_Text_LoveMakingPokeblocks":"I love making {POKEBLOCK}S.\nI always have some BERRIES with me.","BerryBlender_Text_MakePokeblocksUsingBerryBlender":"If you'd like, we could make some {POKEBLOCK}S together using the BERRY BLENDER.","BerryBlender_Text_DontHaveAnyBerriesNoneToSpare":"Oh? You don't have any BERRIES?\nIf I had some left over, I'd gladly give you one…\nBut, I don't have any to spare today. Sorry about that.","BerryBlender_Text_DontHaveAnyBerriesHaveOne":"Oh? You don't have any BERRIES?\nWell, that won't do at all now, will it?\nIf you don't mind leftovers, you can have one of my BERRIES.","BerryBlender_Text_UseItToMakePokeblocksTogether":"We'll use it to make {POKEBLOCK}S together using the BERRY BLENDER.","SafariZone_Text_PlacePokeblockOnFeeder":"Would you like to place a {POKEBLOCK} on the {POKEBLOCK} FEEDER?","SafariZone_Text_PokeblockWasPlaced":"The {STR_VAR_1} was placed on the {POKEBLOCK} FEEDER.","SafariZone_Text_PokeblockStillHere":"The {STR_VAR_1} you left before is still here.","LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ReceptionDontHavePokeblockCase":"Hello!\nThis is the reception counter for POKéMON CONTESTS.\nOh? It appears that you don't have a {POKEBLOCK} CASE yet.\nIn that case, we need to provide you with this!","LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_NowThatWeveClearedThatUp":"Okay, now that we've cleared that up…\nHello!\nThis is the reception counter for POKéMON CONTESTS."}}
